# Fear of Infinity, Eerie: "whenever you fully unlock a Room" (CR 709.5i). Unholy Annex // Ritual Chamber is cast as its left
# door (an enchantment entering, which Fear, still in the library, does not see). Entomb then puts Fear of Infinity in the
# graveyard; unlocking the right door is the special action that fully unlocks the Room, and Bot1 accepts the return.
# Setup follows nykthos-counts-both-doors-of-a-room-once-both-are-unlocked.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Black Lotus
Unholy Annex // Ritual Chamber
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Entomb
Swamp
Swamp
Fear of Infinity
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Unholy Annex // Ritual Chamber.Cast(Ability: Unholy Annex)
Bot1.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Unholy Annex.Doors = Unholy Annex
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Search(Fear of Infinity)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Entomb; Fear of Infinity; Black Lotus
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Unholy Annex.Activate(Ability: right door)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Accept

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Fear of Infinity; Swamp; Swamp
